uota and logs that someone actually reads, and the world map opens up as you grow. What holds you in are the bars (antivirus, captchas, firewalls, monitoring, regulation), and each one keeps shipping new versions: out-evolve the current one and it becomes obsolete, stand still and the next one catches you.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/surrenderly"}